# ==========================================
# Tenant backends (git-managed)
# One line per backend:  <prefix_key>  <host>:<port>;   or   <prefix_key>  <scheme>://<host>:<port>;
# (host:port alone uses http://). Backends created on /admin/ with a URL do NOT go here:
# they are generated into tenants-admin/backends.admin.map automatically.
#
#   http://<nginx>/t/<backend_id>/<uri>  ->  http://<host>:<port>/<uri>
#
# For a backend running on the host machine, use its Docker host-gateway IP
# and published port. Every entry must end with ";".
# ==========================================

# qlporzk7ct    192.168.65.254:8001;
# abc123      another-host:8001;
